{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e2f27c87-6e90-426c-84af-d7d91f89e3b9",
    "name": "BCA SNAP VA - Inquiry & Payment",
    "description": "Collection for testing BCA SNAP Virtual Account endpoints.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import this collection\n2. Fill in `private_key` collection variable with your full PEM content\n3. Run requests in order: Token → Inquiry → Payment → Status\n\n**Signature is auto-computed** by the pre-request scripts — no manual signing needed.\n\nInquiry sets the `inquiry_request_id` variable that Status then reuses, so running them in order needs no copy-pasting. To check a VA that was not created in this run, edit `inquiry_request_id` by hand before running Status.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "53625894",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/53625894-e2f27c87-6e90-426c-84af-d7d91f89e3b9?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4. Resend Callback",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const resp = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('Resend callback response:', JSON.stringify(resp, null, 2));",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Resend returns 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    console.log('eventType:', resp.eventType, '| deliveryStatus:', resp.deliveryStatus);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-API-Key",
                "value": "{{admin_api_key}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/transactions/{{virtual_account_no}}/resend-callback",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "transactions",
                "{{virtual_account_no}}",
                "resend-callback"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Redelivers the **most recent** callback event already on record for this VA (`payment.received` or `va.expired`) to the merchant's registered notification URL.\n\nNo request body. The payload is rebuilt from the VA's **current** state, using the event type of the latest delivery record. Transaction state is never mutated — this only re-sends.\n\n`virtualAccountNo` is matched exactly as stored; if yours carries leading spaces, URL-encode them as `%20`.\n\n**Responses**\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `200` | Resend enqueued — body carries `virtualAccountNo`, `eventType`, `resentAt`, `deliveryStatus` |\n| `401` | Missing/invalid `X-Admin-API-Key` (or `ADMIN_API_KEY` unset on the server) |\n| `404` | Transaction not found |\n| `422` | No callback delivery on record for this transaction, or the VA has no registered notification URL |\n\n**Success example**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"virtualAccountNo\": \"1597366666666\",\n  \"eventType\": \"payment.received\",\n  \"resentAt\": \"2026-08-12T09:15:22Z\",\n  \"deliveryStatus\": \"pending\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Reconcile Transaction",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const resp = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('Reconcile response:', JSON.stringify(resp, null, 2));",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Reconcile returns 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    console.log('outcome:', resp.outcome, '| settled:', resp.settled);",
                  "    console.log('vendor said:', resp.vendorResponseCode, '/', resp.vendorPaymentFlagStatus);",
                  "} else if (pm.response.code === 503) {",
                  "    console.log('⚠️ Reconciliation is not configured on this deployment (RECONCILE_ENABLED / vendor outbound credentials).');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-API-Key",
                "value": "{{admin_api_key}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/transactions/{{virtual_account_no}}/reconcile",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "transactions",
                "{{virtual_account_no}}",
                "reconcile"
              ]
            },
            "description": "On-demand counterpart of the periodic reconciliation sweep: calls the **vendor's** SNAP Inquiry Status service (code 26) to ask what really happened to a transaction this service still records as pending.\n\nIf the vendor reports the payment as successful, the transaction is settled here and the merchant payment callback is sent. Safe to call repeatedly — an already-settled transaction is reported back without firing a second callback.\n\nNo request body. Reach for this when a customer says they paid and the merchant says they did not, rather than waiting for the next sweep.\n\n**Responses**\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `200` | Vendor answered — see `outcome` / `settled` |\n| `401` | Missing/invalid `X-Admin-API-Key` |\n| `404` | Transaction not found |\n| `503` | Reconciliation not configured (`RECONCILE_ENABLED` and the vendor's outbound credentials) |\n\n**Success example**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"virtualAccountNo\": \"1597366666666\",\n  \"outcome\": \"settled\",\n  \"settled\": true,\n  \"vendorResponseCode\": \"2002600\",\n  \"vendorPaymentFlagStatus\": \"00\",\n  \"paidAmount\": { \"value\": \"150000.00\", \"currency\": \"IDR\" },\n  \"reconciledAt\": \"2026-08-12T09:20:41Z\"\n}\n```\n\n`vendorResponseCode` and `vendorPaymentFlagStatus` echo the vendor's raw answer so the outcome can be checked against what it was inferred from."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Operator endpoints behind `AdminAuthMiddleware`. They authenticate with the `X-Admin-API-Key` header (the server's `ADMIN_API_KEY`) — NOT with the SNAP access token or signature — so they need no pre-request script.\n\nIf `ADMIN_API_KEY` is unset on the server, every `/admin/*` route is disabled and answers 401."
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Get Access Token",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// ==========================",
              "// CONFIG",
              "// ==========================",
              "const clientId = pm.collectionVariables.get('client_id');",
              "const privateKeyBase64 = pm.collectionVariables.get('private_key').replace(/\\s+/g, \"\");",
              "",
              "if (!privateKeyBase64) {",
              "    throw new Error('Please set the private_key collection variable with your base64 key');",
              "}",
              "",
              "console.log(clientId, privateKeyBase64);",
              "",
              "// ==========================",
              "// GENERATE X-TIMESTAMP",
              "// ==========================",
              "const now = new Date();",
              "const xTimestamp = now.toISOString().replace('Z', '+07:00');",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('timestamp', xTimestamp);",
              "",
              "// ==========================",
              "// Construct",
              "// ==========================",
              "const message = clientId + \"|\" + xTimestamp;",
              "",
              "const binaryDer = Uint8Array.from(atob(privateKeyBase64), c => c.charCodeAt(0));",
              "const key = await crypto.subtle.importKey(",
              "    \"pkcs8\",",
              "    binaryDer.buffer,",
              "    { name: \"RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5\", hash: \"SHA-256\" },",
              "    false,",
              "    [\"sign\"]",
              ");",
              "",
              "const encoder = new TextEncoder();",
              "const signature = await crypto.subtle.sign(",
              "    \"RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5\",",
              "    key,",
              "    encoder.encode(message)",
              ");",
              "",
              "// ==========================",
              "// Convert signature to Base64",
              "// ==========================",
              "const signatureBase64 = btoa(",
              "    String.fromCharCode(...new Uint8Array(signature))",
              ");",
              "",
              "// ==========================",
              "// SET REQUEST HEADERS",
              "// ==========================",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-TIMESTAMP', value: xTimestamp });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-SIGNATURE', value: signatureBase64 });",
              "",
              "console.log(\"stringToSign:\", message);",
              "console.log(\"X-TIMESTAMP:\", xTimestamp);",
              "console.log(\"X-SIGNATURE:\", signatureBase64);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Auto-save access token to collection variable",
              "const resp = pm.response.json();",
              "if (resp.accessToken) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', resp.accessToken);",
              "    console.log('✅ Access token saved to collection variable!');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('❌ No accessToken in response:', JSON.stringify(resp));",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-CLIENT-KEY",
            "value": "{{client_id}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-TIMESTAMP",
            "value": "{{timestamp}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-SIGNATURE",
            "value": "auto-set-by-pre-request-script"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"grantType\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"additionalInfo\": {}\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/openapi/v1.0/access-token/b2b",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "openapi",
            "v1.0",
            "access-token",
            "b2b"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Get a Bearer access token (valid for 15 minutes).\n\nThe pre-request script auto-computes the RSA-SHA256 signature.\nThe test script auto-saves the token to `access_token` collection variable."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Inquiry VA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// ---- SNAP Symmetric Signature (HMAC-SHA512) ----",
              "",
              "// WIB (+07:00). Jam harus digeser DULU baru diformat: toISOString() selalu",
              "// membaca UTC, jadi menempelkan '+07:00' ke hasil mentahnya menghasilkan",
              "// instant 7 jam di masa lalu -- lolos di dev (APP_ENV=dev melewati cek skew),",
              "// ditolak 4010000 di produksi.",
              "const wib = new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 60 * 60 * 1000);",
              "const timestamp = wib.toISOString().slice(0, 19) + '+07:00';",
              "",
              "// String(), bukan +, di kedua id di bawah. Date.now() dan Math.floor() sama-sama",
              "// Number, jadi 'a + b' menjumlahkannya dan JSON.stringify menulis hasilnya TANPA",
              "// kutip -- server menolak seluruh body dengan 4002400 \"Bad Request\", karena",
              "// inquiryRequestId dan externalId dideklarasikan sebagai string.",
              "const rand4 = String(Math.floor(Math.random() * 9000 + 1000));",
              "const externalId = String(Date.now()) + rand4;",
              "const inquiryRequestId = 'INQ-' + String(Date.now()) + rand4;",
              "",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('timestamp', timestamp);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('inquiry_request_id', inquiryRequestId);",
              "",
              "// Variabel yang belum diisi akan hilang dari body tanpa jejak (JSON.stringify",
              "// membuang key ber-nilai undefined), dan server hanya menjawab \"Invalid",
              "// Mandatory Field\" tanpa menyebut field mana. Lebih baik gagal di sini.",
              "const vars = {",
              "    partner_service_id: pm.collectionVariables.get('partner_service_id'),",
              "    customer_no: pm.collectionVariables.get('customer_no'),",
              "    virtual_account_no: pm.collectionVariables.get('virtual_account_no'),",
              "    amount: pm.collectionVariables.get('amount'),",
              "    client_secret: pm.collectionVariables.get('client_secret'),",
              "    access_token: pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token'),",
              "};",
              "const missing = Object.keys(vars).filter(function (k) { return !vars[k]; });",
              "if (missing.length) {",
              "    throw new Error('Collection variable belum diisi: ' + missing.join(', ') +",
              "        (missing.indexOf('access_token') >= 0 ? ' — jalankan \"1. Get Access Token\" dulu' : ''));",
              "}",
              "",
              "// Body yang PERSIS akan dikirim (JSON minified). Semua nilai wajib string.",
              "const body = JSON.stringify({",
              "    partnerServiceId: String(vars.partner_service_id),",
              "    customerNo: String(vars.customer_no),",
              "    virtualAccountNo: String(vars.virtual_account_no),",
              "    trxDateInit: timestamp,",
              "    channelCode: 6011,",
              "    amount: { value: String(vars.amount), currency: 'IDR' },",
              "    inquiryRequestId: inquiryRequestId,",
              "    additionalInfo: {},",
              "});",
              "",
              "// SHA-256 dari body, base64 standar",
              "const bodyHash = CryptoJS.SHA256(body).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64);",
              "",
              "// stringToSign = METHOD:ENDPOINT:ACCESS_TOKEN:SHA256(BODY):TIMESTAMP",
              "const endpoint = '/openapi/v1.0/transfer-va/inquiry';",
              "const stringToSign = 'POST:' + endpoint + ':' + vars.access_token + ':' + bodyHash + ':' + timestamp;",
              "",
              "// HMAC-SHA512, base64 standar",
              "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA512(stringToSign, vars.client_secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64);",
              "",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-TIMESTAMP', value: timestamp });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-SIGNATURE', value: signature });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-EXTERNAL-ID', value: externalId });",
              "",
              "// WAJIB: body tab ditimpa dengan byte yang persis ditandatangani. Konsekuensinya",
              "// apa pun yang Anda ketik di tab Body request ini DIBUANG -- ubah collection",
              "// variable di atas, bukan tab Body.",
              "pm.request.body.raw = body;",
              "",
              "console.log('body:', body);",
              "console.log('inquiryRequestId:', inquiryRequestId);",
              "console.log('stringToSign:', stringToSign);",
              ""
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const resp = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log('Inquiry response:', JSON.stringify(resp, null, 2));",
              "",
              "pm.test('Inquiry returns 200xx', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(resp.responseCode).to.match(/^200/);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-TIMESTAMP",
            "value": "{{timestamp}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-SIGNATURE",
            "value": "{{Signature}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-PARTNER-ID",
            "value": "{{partner_id}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-EXTERNAL-ID",
            "value": "auto-set-by-pre-request-script"
          },
          {
            "key": "CHANNEL-ID",
            "value": "{{channel_id}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-CLIENT-KEY",
            "value": "",
            "type": "text",
            "disabled": true
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"additionalInfo\": {},\n  \"channelCode\": 6011,\n  \"customerNo\": \"{{customer_no}}\",\n  \"inquiryRequestId\": \"{{inquiry_request_id}}\",\n  \"partnerServiceId\": \"{{partner_service_id}}\",\n  \"trxDateInit\": \"{{timestamp}}\",\n  \"virtualAccountNo\": \"{{virtual_account_no}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/openapi/v1.0/transfer-va/inquiry",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "openapi",
            "v1.0",
            "transfer-va",
            "inquiry"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Inquiry VA bill details before payment.\n\nThe pre-request script:\n1. Generates unique inquiryRequestId\n2. Builds the minified JSON body\n3. Computes SHA-256 hash of the body\n4. Signs with HMAC-SHA512\n5. Overwrites the body with exact signed bytes\n\n⚠️ Do NOT manually edit the Body tab — the pre-request script overwrites it."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Payment VA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// ---- SNAP Symmetric Signature (HMAC-SHA512) ----",
              "const now = new Date();",
              "const wibOffset = 7 * 60 * 60 * 1000; // 7 jam dalam ms",
              "const wibTime = new Date(now.getTime() + wibOffset);",
              "const timestamp = wibTime.toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d{3}Z$/, '+07:00');",
              "const externalId = Date.now().toString() + Math.floor(Math.random() * 9000 + 1000);",
              "const paymentRequestId = Date.now().toString() + Math.floor(Math.random() * 9000 + 1000);",
              "const referenceNo = Date.now().toString().slice(-9);",
              "",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('timestamp', timestamp);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('payment_request_id', paymentRequestId);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('reference_no', referenceNo);",
              "",
              "const partnerServiceId = pm.collectionVariables.get('partner_service_id');",
              "const customerNo = pm.collectionVariables.get('customer_no');",
              "const virtualAccountNo = pm.collectionVariables.get('virtual_account_no');",
              "const trxId = pm.collectionVariables.get('trx_id');",
              "const amount = pm.collectionVariables.get('amount');",
              "",
              "// Build the EXACT body that will be sent (minified JSON)",
              "const body = JSON.stringify({",
              "    partnerServiceId: partnerServiceId,",
              "    customerNo: customerNo,",
              "    virtualAccountNo: virtualAccountNo,",
              "    virtualAccountName: \"Budi Manjo\",",
              "    paymentRequestId: paymentRequestId,",
              "    channelCode: 6011,",
              "    paidAmount: { value: amount, currency: 'IDR' },",
              "    totalAmount: { value: amount, currency: 'IDR' },",
              "    flagAdvise: \"N\",",
              "    trxDateTime: timestamp,",
              "    referenceNo: referenceNo,",
              "    additionalInfo: {}",
              "});",
              "",
              "// SHA-256 hash of the body (standard base64)",
              "const bodyHash = CryptoJS.SHA256(body).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64);",
              "",
              "// stringToSign = METHOD:ENDPOINT:ACCESS_TOKEN:SHA256(BODY):TIMESTAMP",
              "const accessToken = pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token');",
              "if (!accessToken) {",
              "    throw new Error('No access_token — run \"1. Get Access Token\" first');",
              "}",
              "const endpoint = '/openapi/v1.0/transfer-va/payment';",
              "const stringToSign = 'POST:' + endpoint + ':' + accessToken + ':' + bodyHash + ':' + timestamp;",
              "",
              "// HMAC-SHA512 signature (standard base64)",
              "const clientSecret = pm.collectionVariables.get('client_secret');",
              "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA512(stringToSign, clientSecret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64);",
              "",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-TIMESTAMP', value: timestamp });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-SIGNATURE', value: signature });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-EXTERNAL-ID', value: externalId });",
              "",
              "// CRITICAL: overwrite the body with the exact bytes that were signed",
              "pm.request.body.raw = body;",
              "",
              "console.log('paymentRequestId:', paymentRequestId);",
              "console.log('bodyHash:', bodyHash);",
              "console.log('stringToSign:', stringToSign);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const resp = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log('Payment response:', JSON.stringify(resp, null, 2));",
              "",
              "pm.test('Payment returns 200xx', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(resp.responseCode).to.match(/^200/);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-TIMESTAMP",
            "value": "{{timestamp}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-SIGNATURE",
            "value": "auto-set-by-pre-request-script"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-PARTNER-ID",
            "value": "{{partner_id}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-EXTERNAL-ID",
            "value": "auto-set-by-pre-request-script"
          },
          {
            "key": "CHANNEL-ID",
            "value": "{{channel_id}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"additionalInfo\": {},\n  \"channelCode\": 6011,\n  \"customerNo\": \"{{customer_no}}\",\n  \"flagAdvise\": \"N\",\n  \"paidAmount\": {\n    \"currency\": \"IDR\",\n    \"value\": \"150000.00\"\n  },\n  \"partnerServiceId\": \"{{partner_service_id}}\",\n  \"paymentRequestId\": \"{{payment_request_id}}\",\n  \"referenceNo\": \"{{reference_no}}\",\n  \"totalAmount\": {\n    \"currency\": \"IDR\",\n    \"value\": \"150000.00\"\n  },\n  \"trxDateTime\": \"{{timestamp}}\",\n  \"virtualAccountName\": \"Budi Manjo\",\n  \"virtualAccountNo\": \"{{virtual_account_no}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/openapi/v1.0/transfer-va/payment",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "openapi",
            "v1.0",
            "transfer-va",
            "payment"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Send payment notification against a VA.\n\nThe pre-request script:\n1. Generates unique paymentRequestId & referenceNo\n2. Builds the minified JSON body\n3. Computes SHA-256 hash of the body\n4. Signs with HMAC-SHA512\n5. Overwrites the body with exact signed bytes\n\n⚠️ Do NOT manually edit the Body tab — the pre-request script overwrites it.\n\n**Note:** If the VA was already paid, you'll get 4092500 Conflict. Create a new VA first."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Inquiry Status VA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// ---- SNAP Symmetric Signature (HMAC-SHA512) ----",
              "const now = new Date();",
              "const wibOffset = 7 * 60 * 60 * 1000; // 7 jam dalam ms",
              "const wibTime = new Date(now.getTime() + wibOffset);",
              "const timestamp = wibTime.toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d{3}Z$/, '+07:00');",
              "const externalId = Date.now().toString() + Math.floor(Math.random() * 9000 + 1000);",
              "",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('timestamp', timestamp);",
              "",
              "const partnerServiceId = pm.collectionVariables.get('partner_service_id');",
              "const customerNo = pm.collectionVariables.get('customer_no');",
              "const virtualAccountNo = pm.collectionVariables.get('virtual_account_no');",
              "",
              "// inquiryRequestId both resolves the stored transaction here AND is what",
              "// gets forwarded to BCA. '2. Inquiry VA' sets it; to check a different VA,",
              "// edit the inquiry_request_id collection variable by hand.",
              "const inquiryRequestId = pm.collectionVariables.get('inquiry_request_id');",
              "if (!inquiryRequestId) {",
              "    throw new Error('No inquiry_request_id — run \"2. Inquiry VA\" first, or set the variable by hand');",
              "}",
              "",
              "// Build the EXACT body that will be sent (minified JSON)",
              "const body = JSON.stringify({",
              "    partnerServiceId: partnerServiceId,",
              "    customerNo: customerNo,",
              "    virtualAccountNo: virtualAccountNo,",
              "    inquiryRequestId: inquiryRequestId",
              "});",
              "",
              "// SHA-256 hash of the body (standard base64)",
              "const bodyHash = CryptoJS.SHA256(body).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64);",
              "",
              "// stringToSign = METHOD:ENDPOINT:ACCESS_TOKEN:SHA256(BODY):TIMESTAMP",
              "const accessToken = pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token');",
              "if (!accessToken) {",
              "    throw new Error('No access_token — run \"1. Get Access Token\" first');",
              "}",
              "const endpoint = '/openapi/v1.0/transfer-va/status';",
              "const stringToSign = 'POST:' + endpoint + ':' + accessToken + ':' + bodyHash + ':' + timestamp;",
              "",
              "// HMAC-SHA512 signature (standard base64).",
              "// NOTE: do NOT use POST /api/v1/utilities/signature-service to produce this.",
              "// That helper base64-decodes the client secret whenever it happens to be",
              "// decodable, and a 64-char hex secret always is — so it signs with different",
              "// bytes than the server verifies with, and every request 401s.",
              "const clientSecret = pm.collectionVariables.get('client_secret');",
              "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA512(stringToSign, clientSecret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64);",
              "",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-TIMESTAMP', value: timestamp });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-SIGNATURE', value: signature });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-EXTERNAL-ID', value: externalId });",
              "",
              "// CRITICAL: overwrite the body with the exact bytes that were signed",
              "pm.request.body.raw = body;",
              "",
              "console.log('inquiryRequestId:', inquiryRequestId);",
              "console.log('bodyHash:', bodyHash);",
              "console.log('stringToSign:', stringToSign);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
